      "message": "Yes, this is to advance the queue pointer to prevent queue data from being overwritten until transfer is done.\n\nPer Table 10-4, on page 274, SynopsysCore USB programmer\u0027s Guide, the descriptor length field varies, and indicates the number of bytes to transfer.\nI checked that this field becomes zero when the transfer completes.",
